custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T20:46:36-08:00","id":1275438,"title":"","content":"On page 164, Boughs of Burning Autumn still is referencing Swallows Defend the Nest as the multi attack charm even though the charm was switched with Seven-Year Swarm Volley","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T20:55:39-08:00","id":1275440,"title":"","content":"p. 102 has the text, &quot;Traditionally, lost eggs cashiered from the legions were penalized or assigned other services by the Empress; in her absence, their fate is unclear.&quot; This is at the end of the first paragraph of the heading, &quot;Taking the Coin.&quot;<br /> <br /> This text is repeated toward the beginning of p. 103, immediately before the &quot;Entering the Dynasty&quot; Heading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T21:29:00-08:00","id":1275444,"title":"","content":"The charm iron arm block on p304 lacks the mastery keyword","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T06:09:31-08:00","id":1275483,"title":"","content":"Not an error per-say but it might be worth changing the essence/xp cart (p158) so that it has 2 coloums (one for E1 start) rather than having a paragraph underneath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11701-fiikragg","name":"Fiikragg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11701_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T09:40:27-08:00","id":1275542,"title":"","content":"The text explaining Excellencies is incorrect, as said by Vance here: \u200b<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1275486#post1275486\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...86#post1275486</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T13:03:01-08:00","id":1275607,"title":"","content":"Have been taking a break from holiday family nonsense to go through this like I did for the Core way back when. First several sections of proofreading follows, but there will be more to come!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pre-Introduction</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1: No space between the colon and the name Adam in the second playtesters group</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1: In the legal notice, there is a missing period between \u201ccopyright concerned\u201d and \u201cThis book uses\u201d</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3: In the Table of Contents, Houses Cathak, Peleps, Tepet, and V\u2019neef lack the same Social Standing subheading as the other Houses get (save Iselsi, but\u2026 Iselsi.) See Chapter Two proofreading notes for further details.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3: In the Table of Contents, the House subheadings are inconsistent regarding the name of one section. Houses Cathak, Ledaal, Mnemon, Peleps, Ragara, Tepet, and V\u2019neef have a section called \u201cEnemies and Alliances.\u201d Houses Cynis, Sesus, and Iselsi instead have a section called \u201cAllies and Enemies.\u201d House Nellens has \u201cEnemies &amp; Alliances.\u201d This is reflected in the Chapter Two appearances of these sections.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3: In the Table of Contents, the House sobriquets exhibit inconsistency in whether or not auxiliary words are capitalized. House Cynis\u2019s capitalizes \u201cOn\u201d and \u201cThe,\u201d and House Sesus\u2019s also capitalizes \u201cThe,\u201d but Houses Cathak, Ledaal, Mnemon, Nellens, Peleps, Tepet, V\u2019neef, and Iselsi do not. Furthermore, all instances of \u201cThat\u201d are capitalized in sobriquets, save for the one appearing in Ledaal\u2019s. This is reflected in the Chapter Two appearances of these sobriquets.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Introduction</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">11, 12: Small inconsistency in the term </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Dynast</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. It is defined as a Dragon-Blood belonging to a Great House, but the definition of </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>primary school</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> uses the term for the unExalted children of Great Houses who attend alongside patricians (and, later in the text, it\u2019s used for un-Exalted members of the Houses as well; cf p. 51)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter One</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">18: There is a reference to procreative essence; it seems like the book mostly refers to this setting concept as \u201cprogenitive potential\u201d instead in later chapters.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">24: In the sentence beginning \u201cLookshy\u2019s gentes believe,\u201d the comma before the word \u201cand\u201d changes the meaning of the sentence: the subclause beginning \u201crestore the Shogunate\u2019s\u201d has as its intended subject \u201ca worthy Shogun,\u201d but by putting the comma before \u201cand\u201d the sentence structure implies the subject to instead be \u201cLookshy\u2019s gentes\u201d. (Compare the previous sentence, which has similar structure, but in that case both verbs have as their subject \u201cThe Seventh Legion\u201d.)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">24: The tag \u201cPlay a member\u201d is in normal-weight font, while the Scarlet Dynasty\u2019s, Empire of Prasads, and Outcastes\u2019 tags are all in boldface.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">28: The tag \u201cPlay a member\u201d is in normal-weight font, while the Scarlet Dynasty\u2019s, Empire of Prasads, and Outcastes\u2019 tags are all in boldface.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter Two</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">35: The House Symbology sidebar renders House V\u2019neef as Vineef.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">36: The Social Standing heading here uses a certain font design, but in other Houses\u2019 sections, Social Standing uses the same font design as e.g. House Economies (compare p.39). Probably related to the proofreading note from page 3.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">36: \u201cand invited some of the Dynasty\u2019s most notorious gossips and rumormongers were present.\u201d Looks like an editing artifact; either drop \u201cwere present\u201d or change \u201cinvited\u201d to \u201censured\u201d.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">37: \u201cThe legion, the dragon, the scale: Each of these\u201d has the first word capitalized after a colon, which is not done elsewhere (compare pp 17, 18, 22, 24).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">40: \u201con the activities Dragon-Blooded great and small\u201d missing \u201cof\u201d between \u201cactivities\u201d and \u201cDragon-Blooded\u201d</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">41: \u201cOf course, House Cynis, watches, reports, and records.\u201d There shouldn\u2019t be a comma after \u201cCynis\u201d.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">52: The first sentence under Enemies &amp; Alliances has the first word capitalized after a colon, which is not done elsewhere (though in this case it introduces an aphorism which is a complete sentence, so that may be a deliberate choice).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">55: Peleps lacks a Social Standing section.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">66: Tepet lacks a Social Standing section.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">69-70: V\u2019neef lacks a Social Standing section.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":3907,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","user":"Aretii","date":". 12-20-2018, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T19:15:51-08:00","id":1275704,"title":"","content":"Page 126: Other Outcast sidebar - Heaven's Dragons is spelled Heavenis Dragons. The same thing with Yatani's Children, it's spelled Yataniis Children. Looks like someone did a find and replace for ' with a non-standard i character. As the i doesn't appear to be a standard English i. Odd thing is, it registers as a ' but displays as a i.<br /> <br /> Page 107: First paragraph, last sentence is missing a period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":12102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","user":"Maudova","date":". 12-20-2018, 11:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T20:48:20-08:00","id":1275713,"title":"","content":"Under &quot;Adding Bonus Dice&quot; it is stated that Dragon-Blooded round their limit for static value increases up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Avatar by Raven &amp; Blue Jay.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/663-aleks","name":"Aleks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar663_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-20T23:39:10-08:00","id":1275735,"title":"","content":"Not an error in the text, but I noticed I am not listed in the Kickstarter backers, despite having backed at a fairly high level. I sent Robert Vance a PM about this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> This one is for all my Exigents...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/102-lordwyrmsbane","name":"LordWyrmsBane","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T00:15:44-08:00","id":1275740,"title":"","content":"I was told on the discord that I could potentially have my backer name changed. If that's ok, I was a Scion and used the name Mnemon Marik and would prefer it be changed to the name Iselsi Nadia as she's a character I've since played and had a lot of fun with. Again, if that's not possible I'm totally ok with that. Loving the art and wish you all the best of luck!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12044,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon","user":"ChaosArchon","date":". 12-21-2018, 03:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12044-chaosarchon","name":"ChaosArchon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12044_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T09:44:18-08:00","id":1275830,"title":"","content":"In the PDF bookmarks, &quot;Signature Charms&quot; and &quot;New Keywords&quot; are child elements of &quot;The Elemental Aura&quot; (in chapter seven), but they are siblings in the text and logically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T12:38:07-08:00","id":1275866,"title":"","content":"For backer credits, my last name hasn't been included (quite possibly my mistake when submitting it) - under Founder of the Realm, Ashley should be Ashley Thompson. (Either that or there's a second, first name only Ashley and I was left off altogether?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T19:58:25-08:00","id":1275982,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I wasn\u2019t on the backer list either. There might need to be another review of that info.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T21:06:34-08:00","id":1276007,"title":"","content":"In chapter ten only Cynis Cogen, Ledaal Kes, and Amon Mora have correct peripheral essence pool totals in accordance with the finishing touches on page 139. Is this wrong or is this after comitted essence with them comitting different amounts of essence from different pools per the characters personal preferences? Everyone else has correct personal essence pool totals but incorrect periheral pools except Cathak Kainan who is completely wrong.The numbers also seem to have no rhyme or reason as Kainan is essence 5 with 15 personal motes and 29 peripheral motes while Mnemon has 16 and 32 respectively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24445,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","user":"Arkayriel","date":". 12-22-2018, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T23:03:26-08:00","id":1276021,"title":"","content":"Got through another few chapters. I am also one of the people who isn't on the backer list (I should be a Founder of the Realm, according to Kickstarter, and I verified that my name is there in the BackerKit survey).<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter Three</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">101: \u201cAt the end of this year, the grandest feast\u201d The phrase \u201cthis year\u201d might be an editing artifact; from context, it sounds like it\u2019s referring to a predetermined length of time that the outcaste spends at the Obsidian Mirror, but that\u2019s not actually mentioned anywhere else in this section, and it\u2019s also possible that the Obsidian Mirror just does this feast of choosing at the end of every calendar year, in which case the word &quot;this&quot; is confusing.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">107: \u201cCommemorative heros\u2019 plaques\u201d The word \u201cheros\u2019\u201d should be either \u201chero\u2019s\u201d or \u201cheroes\u2019\u201d depending on intended meaning.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">107: The sentence beginning \u201cPatricians and wealthy peasants\u201d lacks a terminating period.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter Four</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">112: \u201cMany Amilars follow the Interventionist philosophy: They have\u201d As with the note from page 37, this is inconsistent with how capitalization is used after a colon in most cases in the book (cf p114, last paragraph of Gens Maheka, or 115, last paragraph of Gens Teresu)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">122: \u201cthe word of a Righteous Warrior should always guarantee the truth of an assertion, and for the weight it carries, should never be given cheaply.\u201d This should have a comma after \u201cand,\u201d since \u201cfor the weight it carries\u201d is a prepositional phrase inserted into the second modal phrase of the clause.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">122: \u201cfor she has something greater to fight for.\u201d The use of the pronoun \u201cshe\u201d seems strange, since the Righteous Warrior was consistently \u201che\u201d in this sidebar, and it can\u2019t refer to Sextes Jylis because Sextes Jylis is male.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">126: The Other Outcastes sidebar renders \u201cHeaven\u2019s Dragons\u201d as \u201cHeavenis Dragons\u201d and \u201cYatani\u2019s Children\u201d as \u201cYataniis Children\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter Six</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">145: \u201cThey play much the same role within Dragon-Blooded societies, innovating solutions to the problems it faces and devising plans for how it might become greater.\u201d This has a subject-pronoun agreement issue: \u201csocieties\u201d is plural, yet later in the sentence takes the pronoun \u201cit\u201d and the verbs are singular rather than plural.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">151: The Anima Banner section uses the word \u201csiakas,\u201d but elsewhere in the line, the plural of \u201csiaka\u201d is \u201csiaka\u201d (cf. Ex3 Core pp 280 and 556).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">154: In the \u201cBonfire/Iconic\u201d description, the sentence \u201cStealth becomes impossible\u201d is missing a terminal period.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">158: Inconsistent capitalization in fixed training times: Specialty and Willpower don\u2019t capitalize the first letter of the Training Time column, while Spell does.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":3907,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","user":"Aretii","date":". 12-22-2018, 02:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T06:00:53-08:00","id":1276037,"title":"","content":"Now that I look closer Tepet Ejava has essence pools are in line with the committed cost of her artifacts so that's probably the reason. Still confused by Kainan's 15 personal pool and 29 peripheral pool though, unless he has artifacts not represented. And why 1 point taken from his personal pool? Mnemon has essence pools in line with her Daiklave and armor but not what ever assosiated cost come with something as powerful as the Emerald Thurible. Does she only attune to it when she's attempting a summoning or is this incorrect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24445,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","user":"Arkayriel","date":". 12-22-2018, 09:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T07:40:40-08:00","id":1276044,"title":"","content":"On page 291, in the charm \u200bEarthshaker Attack at the bottom of the page, there are two dots after (Strength), I believe there should only be one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T11:09:03-08:00","id":1276091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1275256-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-errata?p=1275982#post1275982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I wasn\u2019t on the backer list either. There might need to be another review of that info.</div> </div> </div> </div>Following the provided link to BackerKit, all I get is something that lets me receive another survey.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure I already filled one of those out. Do I need to do that again to get my backer copy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T16:46:44-08:00","id":1276145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1275256-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-errata?p=1276091#post1276091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Following the provided link to BackerKit, all I get is something that lets me receive another survey.<br /> <br /> Pretty sure I already filled one of those out. Do I need to do that again to get my backer copy?</div> </div> </div> </div>Tip: try logging into your backerkit account first, then use the link (or just navigate to the rewards page). If you are not already logged in, it seems to send you through registration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T17:08:06-08:00","id":1276148,"title":"","content":"Please restrict posts to this thread to errata only. Feel free to create new threads to discuss topics or give advice. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T21:18:15-08:00","id":1276178,"title":"","content":"At the beginning of the paragraph describing Signature Charms on page 163, the text reads &quot;Each <i><b>Charm</b></i> has five puissant elemental Signatures.&quot; Presumably this should actually read &quot;Each <b><i>Ability</i></b> has five puissant elemental Signatures.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24054-mila34","name":"Mila34","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-23T03:10:46-08:00","id":1276204,"title":"","content":"page 355<br /> at the beginning of the first section on The Slug: &quot;... courtiers move to and fro though the gates...&quot;. Seems it should be: &quot;... courtiers move to and from through the gates...&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-23T16:53:32-08:00","id":1276328,"title":"","content":"pg. 34: &quot;while meeting with generals, admirals and strategists to orchestrate military operations.&quot; Insert comma between &quot;admirals&quot; and &quot;and.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 46: &quot;Her ravenous curiosity about all things mystical paired with her steel backbone led her&quot; Insert comma between &quot;mystical&quot; and &quot;paired.&quot; Insert comma between &quot;backbone&quot; and &quot;led.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 47: &quot;Today, the house has right of first refusal on all of the throne\u2019s building contracts.&quot; Capitalize &quot;throne.&quot; &quot;Throne&quot; in the sense of the Empress's government has already been used with capitalization.<br /> <br /> pg. 49: &quot;She intends on decimating their house, and forcing them to pay war reparations and cancel her family\u2019s debts.&quot; Delete &quot;and&quot; before &quot;forcing.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 50: &quot;Once a scavenger prince and wandering archaeologist, he rose to power after unearthing a relic of the First Age that prolongs his lifespan and binds the satrapy\u2019s citizenry to its ironclad laws.&quot; Change &quot;its&quot; to &quot;his.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 55: &quot;Peleps scions travel Creation\u2019s oceans and waterways. bringing back tales and artifacts that excite and intrigue.&quot; Change period after &quot;waterways&quot; to a comma.<br /> <br /> pg. 56: &quot;selling seizing captured contraband and ships to bolster its finances.&quot; Delete &quot;seizing.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 62: &quot;sustained beyond his years by his daiklave Blood Zenith, as it feeds him&quot; Delete comma between &quot;Zenith&quot; and &quot;as.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 126: &quot;Some fall afoul of Heaven\u2019s law, and are exiled&quot; Delete comma after &quot;law&quot;<br /> <br /> Error in apostrophes for &quot;Heaven's Dragons&quot; and &quot;Yatani's Children.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 127: &quot;in equal measure with secret ambitions&quot; Insert comma between &quot;measure&quot; and &quot;with.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 130: &quot;Her skin goes white in places, yet still, she does not move.&quot; Delete comma between &quot;still&quot; and &quot;she.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 134: &quot;killing my Hearthmates and I made them&quot; Insert comma between &quot;Hearthmates&quot; and &quot;and.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 160: \u201c\u2026Let me just get my sword,\u201d she said. The opening quotation mark is orphaned.<br /> <br /> pg. 347: &quot;When one of his lovers died to an Anathema,&quot; Change &quot;to&quot; to &quot;by&quot; or &quot;with.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 349: The &quot;Aspect&quot; line of Kes's QC block is orphaned at the end of this page while the rest of the block is on 350.<br /> <br /> pg. 356: &quot;From behind that veil, he rules a shadow network of spies, informants, messengers and assassins that&quot; Insert comma between &quot;messengers&quot; and &quot;and.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/740-anaximander","name":"Anaximander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar740_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-24T11:52:54-08:00","id":1276506,"title":"","content":"P332. Horizon Cleaver is meant to be a Grand Grimcleaver and have the Two-Handed and Reaching tags.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-26T22:36:03-08:00","id":1276960,"title":"","content":"On page 102, the sentence &quot;Unlike mortals, lost eggs must give fifty years of service rather than twenty, their long span of life (to say nothing of their power) obliging a greater commitment to the Empress\u2019 service.&quot; seems to refer to nonexistent text on mortal service in the legions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12827-electro","name":"Electro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-28T11:32:21-08:00","id":1277233,"title":"","content":"This part took longer to get through than I'd expected, between holiday commitments and getting struck down by hellplague.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Chapter Seven</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">General note: Throughout this chapter, \u201caspect\u201d is almost always lowercase. Elsewhere in the book, it\u2019s almost always uppercase. I am sufficiently unsure of the editorial intent here that I am not flagging any of these specifically, but wanted to point it out so that you can go through and check your usage for consistency with intent.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">General note: Several charms that create environmental hazards capitalize the d in damage when giving the hazards\u2019 statistics (e.g. Bellows-Pumping Stride p.168, Exploding Evidence Technique p. 208), and some keep it lowercase (Falling Star Maneuver p. 171, Elemental Burst Technique p. 218). Capital seems more common.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">160: The opening quotation mark in the second-to-last paragraph is on a different line than any of the actual dialogue.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">163: \u201cEach Charm has five puissant elemental Signatures.\u201d \u201cCharm\u201d should be \u201cAbility\u201d.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">166: \u201cagainst a nontrivial foe as close range.\u201d \u201cas\u201d should be \u201cat\u201d.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">171: The formatting for Seething Dragon Footprint is a little screwed up; Prerequisite Charms isn\u2019t bolded and there are no line breaks after it.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">176: \u201cShe adds (Stamina) to either the raw damage of a withering attack, or as bonus dice to the control roll of a clinch.\u201d This is super nitpicky even by my standards, but \u201ceither\u201d and \u201cto\u201d should swap positions, because the second possibility presented is using \u201cas\u201d as its preposition rather than \u201cto,\u201d so \u201cto\u201d should go after \u201ceither\u201d so it only modifies the first possibility.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">190: Consistency issue: Forge-Hand Prana\u2019s duration is \u201cOne project </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>or</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> One scene\u201d. However, Vault-Emptying Whirlwind Heist (p. 205) has a duration of \u201c(Essence) days </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>or</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> until crime is completed\u201d; in the former Charm, the first letter after \u201cor\u201d is capitalized, and in the latter it is not.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">191: Ember-Amid-Smoke Misdirection has its first paragraph formatted like an inset textbox for some reason, probably just a glitch.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">192: Flow With Strife\u2019s second paragraph mentions a mote cost, despite this Charm not costing Essence.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">220: Dragon Vortex Attack capitalizes Difficulty throughout the text of the Charm, which no other Charm that creates environmental hazards does.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">251: Scattered Pearl Hoof Falls has its formatting a little screwed up; the title isn\u2019t in Charm-title style and it\u2019s on the same line as Cost/Mins.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">257: \u201ctreating this a Minor Tie of trust to her\u201d I believe this should have the word \u201cas\u201d between \u201cthis\u201d and \u201ca\u201d.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">268: Depth-Stalking Discipline uses the word siakas, but as mentioned for the note in Chapter Six, I believe the plural of siaka is siaka.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T06:04:51-08:00","id":1277341,"title":"","content":"OK, in contrast to Chapter 7, the last three chapters flew by.<br /> <br /> Chapter Eight<br /> 289: There is no line break between the Prerequisite Charms line and the first paragraph of body text for Tornado Offense Technique.<br /> 291: \u201con top of this Charm\u2019s base damage of (Strength)..\u201d Extra period after \u201c(Strength)\u201d.<br /> 299: There is no line break between the Prerequisite Charms line and the first paragraph of body text for Spirit-Wracking Method.<br /> 300: There is no line break between the Prerequisite Charms line and the first paragraph of body text for Wood Dragon Succor.<br /> 301: There is no line break between the Prerequisite Charms line and the first paragraph of body text for Cleansing Flame Strike.<br /> <br /> Chapter Nine<br /> 323: \u201cmay occasionally draw disparaging marks from other Dynasts\u201d I believe \u201cmarks\u201d here should be \u201cremarks\u201d.<br /> 330: \u201cbut those waters bely the violent\u201d \u201cbely\u201d is a less-common spelling of \u201cbelie,\u201d which I would normally not point out except that the common spelling is used later (p. 345) and so I am flagging it for the sake of consistency.<br /> 332: Horizon Cleaver\u2019s stat block is inconsistent; it is given the Heavy category and stat line, but that would make it a grand grimcleaver rather than a grimcleaver, and its tags are consistent with a grimcleaver.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":3907,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","user":"Aretii","date":". 12-29-2018, 11:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T04:29:25-08:00","id":1277642,"title":"","content":"Chiming in with the &quot;Not on the backer list&quot; crowd. I don't recall getting anything asking what I would like my name to show up as, so I may have missed an email on that one -- Is there somewhere we can contact to make sure that gets done?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24956-the_sye","name":"The_Sye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24956_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T05:39:38-08:00","id":1277650,"title":"","content":"Please can you change &quot;Simon Westfield&quot; in the backer list to &quot;Reality Cheque&quot;. Thanks!<br /> <br /> The survey originally had 3 questions, then two more (relating to backer names) were added when I logged back in - possibly why people didn't know about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13646-realitycheque","name":"realitycheque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13646_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T11:28:56-08:00","id":1277688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The_Sye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1275256-dragon-blooded-what-fire-has-wrought-errata?p=1277642#post1277642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chiming in with the &quot;Not on the backer list&quot; crowd. I don't recall getting anything asking what I would like my name to show up as, so I may have missed an email on that one -- Is there somewhere we can contact to make sure that gets done?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can do this through BackerKit, as per the Kickstarter email about this issue that went out today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T16:02:08-08:00","id":1277727,"title":"","content":"I debated putting this on its own thread because it's not technically a typo or misplaced element, but I would like to point out that the charm Flashing Saga Flourish pg. 211 is more powerful, despite only being usable once per story, than the Solar equivalent Heaven-Drawing Discipline EX3 pg. 329. My reasoning being that Flashing Saga says &quot;a long-form work like a book or collection of poetry requires only a day&quot; while Heaven-Drawing explicitly states it doesn't reduce the interval below weeks until two additional repurchases and essence five. Not to mention Flashing Saga gives doubles 7s on the roll while Heaven-Drawing just enhances speed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24938,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24938-mmooney","user":"Mmooney","date":". 01-01-2019, 03:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24938-mmooney","name":"Mmooney","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-01T20:38:16-08:00","id":1277988,"title":"","content":"Graven Stone Edict says those under its effect are treated as if always touching or wielding cold iron, but cold iron hasn't been mentioned before and it's always been that fae are weak to ordinary iron.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12827-electro","name":"Electro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T16:13:04-08:00","id":1278723,"title":"","content":"pg 302/303 - Lone Spark Lights the Conflagration lists a prerequisite as &quot;Light-on-Dark Defense&quot; while the Charm itself is called &quot;Light-on-Dark Shield&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24959-mynorin","name":"Mynorin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T00:58:58-08:00","id":1278785,"title":"","content":"Unslakable thirst of the Devil-Maw, page 313: &quot;A dice of decisive damage&quot; should just be &quot;Dice of decisive damage.&quot;<br /> <br /> EDIT: it has been brought to my attention that the A stands for aggravated, please ignore t